			"notes": "0.3.0\nNew public test version.\n--------------------------\nNew Content:\n\nNEW DIMENSION - DREAMSCAPE\n\nItems:\n- Added Flowtarem\n- Added Resin Flowtarem\n- Added Flowtarem Seeds\n- Added Echo Arrow\n- Added Bunch of Echo Berries\n- Added Bunch of Amethyst Sweet Berries\n- Added Bunch of Strange Beetroots\n- Added Bunch of Beetroots\n- Added Bunch of Sweet Berries\n- Added Bunch of Sugar Canes\n- Added Bunch of Potatoes\n- Added Bunch of Apples\n- Added Bunch of Carrots\n- Added Bunch of Chorus Fruits\n- Added Bunch of Flowtarems\n- Added Bunch of Resin Flowtarems\n\nMusic Discs:\n- Added Dusk to Dawn\n- Added Only Once More\n- Added Broken Eternity\n\nBlocks:\n- Added Dream Echo Statue\n- Added Dream Woods (Green, Purple, Blue, Light Blue)\n- Added Reinforced Shulker Box\n- Added Dreamed Obsidian\n- Added Dreamed Powered Obsidian\n\nPotions:\n- Added Potion of Silence\n\nTools & Equipment:\n- Added Extender\n- Updated Echo Bow\n\nOther:\n- Added new paintings\n- Added new background music for all Plain biomes and Deep Dark\n- Echo Berries give the Silence effect"
